{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act12d0_level_act12d0_09_beg",
  "groupId": "act12d0",
  "stageId": "act12d0_09",
  "title": "走出密林",
  "storyCode": "RI-9",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act12d0/level_act12d0_09_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "8e03519ca6b2207bcaf5578345c1b490ef4e98ceb5252592b712354afbb88af3",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_village_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "特米米，你沒事吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不准嘉維爾你離開！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？為什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因為、因為我不想再和你分開了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "本來我就是打算奪得大酋長的位置然後再把你留下來的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "難道說，這次祭典是你舉辦的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒錯，如果不是祖瑪瑪你忽然殺出來，原本應該是由我來成為大酋長的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......原來如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？你們在說啥？"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "祭典能舉辦起來很奇怪。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？博士，你在說什麼？祭典怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你很聰明，外鄉人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "稍微想一想就知道了，嘉維爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "自從你離開後，大部族分裂成了現在的各個小部族，大家失去了統一的領袖，也就很少再會聚在一起做什麼事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也就是說，祭典沒道理忽然就這麼舉辦了，需要有人把大家組織起來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？祭典難道不是你舉辦的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是啊，大醜一直是缺少引擎的狀態，而且還不能算完成，我原本打算再過至少一年才聯絡其他部族重新舉辦祭典的，結果它就這麼舉辦了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對我來說這也很突然，但是既然舉辦了，那就舉辦了，我相信即使還沒完成，大醜也能讓所有人吃驚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是沒想到你回來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這麼說來，把我叫回來的也是特米米。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "難道說，這一切都是你計畫好的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為了成為大酋長，我在這幾年裡用書上學來的方法說服了其他部族的人，原本最後會由我來成為大酋長的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是現在也還來得及......願意聽我指揮的部族已經就在外面了，大醜也已經倒下，沒有人可以阻止我把嘉維爾留下來了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼你非要把我留下來不可？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因為、因為......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_jungle_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡、這裡是哪裡......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗚嗚嗚，我要回家......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呀啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，沒事吧，特米米。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘉維爾......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，你這傢伙真是的，一不注意就跑到這種地方來了，找死我了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘉維爾，你在流血！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？沒事沒事，這點小傷不算什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走，我們回家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_village_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘉維爾是我的救命恩人，我最喜歡嘉維爾了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且、而且嘉維爾是最強的，只要有嘉維爾當大酋長，一定能夠帶領大家的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，我還以為過去幾年你長大了，這不是和以前沒什麼兩樣嗎......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我有重要的事要去做，你攔不住我的，特米米。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......書上說，“留不住他的心，那就留住他的人”，書上還說，“只要能讓他留在我身邊，被他討厭也沒有關係”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以、所以即使被嘉維爾你討厭，我也要把你留在這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "誒，她該不會被什麼三流言情小說給毒害了吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在，大醜已經倒下，你們也被消耗了許多，你們是不可能戰勝我的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "乖乖投降的話，我、我就不會傷害你們！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是留不住我的，特米米。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......那、那就由不得你了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所有人一起上吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
